{"product_id":"charlie-bone-and-the-shadow-of-badlock","title":"Charlie Bone and the shadow of Badlock","description":"\u003cp\u003eClassic magic and mystery from one of Britain’s best-loved authors of fantasy adventure. Perfect for fans of Harry Potter, Eva Ibbotson, Cornelia Funke’s Inkheart and Shane Hegarty’s Darkmouth.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eAn Academy for magic and special talents. A destiny unfulfilled. A secret legacy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe seventh instalment of the international best-selling series from Jenny Nimmo starring Charlie Bone.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe enchanter Count Harken – the shadow in the painting of the Red King – is back and determined to stop Billy from discovering a life-changing family secret. His incredible power reaches out from the dark, magical land of Badlock, through space and time, to wreak revenge on Charlie and his friends.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:23 x 200  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Jenny Nimmo \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781405280983 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44290341240985,"sku":"12RB29781405280983","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/ecac604a4366f466944dce3f9204ad0b.jpg?v=1752150813","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/charlie-bone-and-the-shadow-of-badlock","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}